Package: infinitefactor
Title: Bayesian Factor Analysis with Infinite Factor Priors
Version: 2.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eduardo", "Vasquez", email = "eduardo.vasqueztapia@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Evan", "Poworoznek", email = "infinitefactorpackage@gmail.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Nico", "Anceschi", role = c("aut")))
Description: Sampler and post-processing functions for semi-parametric
    Bayesian infinite factor models and Bayesian Latent Factor Regression with Interactions from F. Ferrari & D. Dunson (2021) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2020.1745813>.
    Implements different priors for the factor loadings such as MGPS from A. Bhattacharya & D. Dunson (2011) <doi:10.1093/biomet/asr013>,
    Row-wise Dirichlet-Laplace from A. Bhattacharya et al. (2015) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2014.960967>,
    CUSP from S. Legramanti et al. (2020) <doi:10.1093/biomet/asaa008>,
    SIS from L. Schiavon (2022) <doi:10.1093/biomet/asab056> and 
    CMR from E. Bersson et al. (2025) <doi:10.48550/ARXIV.2504.08220>.
    Post-processing functions include the MatchAlign
    algorithm from E. Poworoznek et al. (2025) <doi:10.1214/25-BA1544>, which returns identifiable
    factor loadings through succesive application of orthogonalization
    procedures and resolution of column label and sign switching.
